    PostDetail -->|返回| BoardList
    PostDetail -->|编辑按钮| CreatePost
    CreatePost -->|发布成功| BoardList

    Home -->|导航栏 · 铃铛图标| Notif
    Notif -->|点击通知项| PostDetail
    PostDetail -->|点击铃铛| Notif

    Home -->|导航栏 · 头像| Profile
    Profile -->|返回| Home
    Notif -->|头像| Profile
    Profile -->|通知入口| Notif

    Home -->|"管理员入口（角色校验）"| AdminDash
    AdminDash --> UserMgmt
    AdminDash --> BoardMgmt
    AdminDash --> ReportMgmt
    UserMgmt --> AdminDash
    BoardMgmt --> AdminDash
    ReportMgmt --> AdminDash
    AdminDash -->|返回首页| Home
